├── frontend/               # Modern React + Vite + Tailwind + WebGL Dashboard
├── compiler/               # Python-based ONNX parsing, quantization, and LLM agent
├── templates/              # C/C++ embedded firmware templates (ESP32, STM32, CMSIS-NN)
├── docs/                   # Architecture specs, benchmark reports, and deck slides
└── README.md
